# Audit gap register

Audit date: 2026-07-13

Scope: the two direct scanners, their boundary/property tests, the independent
tiny oracle, provenance generation/auditing, and clean-build dependency
evidence. `CLOSED` means the focused repository guarantee is implemented and
tested; it does not mean the global A303656 statement is proved.

